  "releaseNotes": "feat(json): add in-place insert and delete operations for JsonModel\n\n      - Add Insert() API for object properties and array elements\n      - Add Delete() API for object properties and array elements\n      - Support direct buffer mutation without full JSON reserialization\n      - Preserve zero-allocation mutation pipeline\n      - Keep JsonTape offsets synchronized after structural changes\n      - Improve dynamic JSON editing for high-performance scenarios\n      - Add benchmarks for insert/delete performance",
